<title>USA: Bio-Dental holders approve Zila merger.</title>
<headline>Bio-Dental holders approve Zila merger.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio-Dental Technologies Corp said Tuesday its shareholders had approved the company's pending merger with Zila Inc.</p>
<p>The two companies will now coordinate the remaining steps needed to consummate the merger, the company said.</p>
<p>Zila announced in August it had agreed to buy Bio-Dental in a stock swap.</p>
